@startuml sequence_submission
title Fluxo de Envio, Processamento Assincrono e Revisao Humana (Acessilia Gestor & Core)

autonumber
actor "Professor / Docente" as Prof
boundary "Interface Web (Gestor)" as UI
control "Materials Controller" as Controller
control "Material Service" as Service
database "Banco SQLite (WAL)" as DB
control "BotAcess Client" as Client
entity "Motor Acessilia (Core IA)" as Core
actor "Aluno (Discente)" as Aluno
actor "Revisor de Acessibilidade" as Revisor

== 1. Envio do Material Original (v1) ==
Prof -> UI : Envia arquivo (PDF, DOCX, etc.) com metadados
UI -> Controller : POST /materiais (multipart/form-data)
Controller -> Service : uploadMaterial(dados, arquivo, user)
Service -> DB : INSERT INTO materials (status = 'ENVIADO')
Service -> DB : INSERT INTO material_versions (v1, 'ORIGINAL')
Service -> DB : INSERT INTO processing_jobs (status = 'PENDING', idempotency_key)
Service --> Controller : { material, version, job }

== 2. Despacho Assincrono para o Motor Core ==
Controller -> Client : sendDocumentForProcessing(file, jobId)
Client -> Core : POST /api/v1/jobs (multipart com token/apiKey)

alt Motor Core Disponivel
    Core --> Client : 202 Accepted { task_id, position, status: 'QUEUED' }
    Client --> Service : { success: true, externalJobId }
    Service -> DB : UPDATE processing_jobs (status = 'PROCESSING', external_job_id)
    Service -> DB : UPDATE materials (current_status = 'PROCESSANDO')
else Falha de Conexao ou Motor Indisponivel
    Client --> Service : { success: false, error: 'Indisponivel' }
    Service -> DB : UPDATE processing_jobs (status = 'FAILED')
    Service -> DB : UPDATE materials (current_status = 'FALHA_PROCESSAMENTO')
end

== 3. Conclusao do Processamento de IA (v2) ==
Core -> UI : Webhook POST /api/v1/webhooks/bot-acess { externalJobId, status: 'COMPLETED', downloadUrl }
UI -> Service : handleJobCompleted(jobId)
Service -> DB : INSERT INTO material_versions (v2, 'PROCESSADO_BOT')
Service -> DB : UPDATE materials (current_status = 'AGUARDANDO_REVISAO')
Service -> UI : SSE emit('notify', 'MATERIAL_UPDATED')

== 4. Acesso Antecipado do Aluno com Selo Informativo ==
Aluno -> UI : Acessa /materiais/:id
UI -> Service : canUserDownloadMaterial(aluno, materialId)
Service --> UI : Autorizado (com flag isPendingReview = true)
UI --> Aluno : Exibe aviso "Processado automaticamente por IA em [DATA]. Aguardando validacao do NAI."
Aluno -> UI : Download do documento (HTML/TXT/DOCX com Selo Institucional e QR Code)

== 5. Revisao Humana e Homologacao NAI (v3) ==
Revisor -> UI : Inicia revisao em /materiais/:id/revisar
UI -> Service : startReview(versionId, revisor)
Revisor -> UI : Valida descricoes de imagem (alt-text) e estrutura
Revisor -> UI : Aprova material (POST /revisoes/:id/concluir, status = 'APROVADO')
Service -> DB : UPDATE materials (current_status = 'APROVADO')
Service -> DB : INSERT INTO material_versions (v3, 'REVISADO_HUMANO')
Service -> UI : SSE emit('notify', 'MATERIAL_APROVADO')

== 6. Selo Final com Conformidade Homologada ==
Aluno -> UI : Visualiza material homologado
UI --> Aluno : Exibe "Revisado e Aprovado pelo NAI em [DATA_APROVACAO]" com Certificado Digital WCAG 2.2 AAA

@enduml
